    <node id="THE REBELLION, THOUGH UNSUCCESSFUL, MARKED A PIVOTAL MOMENT IN CANADIAN HISTORY AND LED TO SIGNIFICANT CONSTITUTIONAL CHANGES THAT SHAPED THE FUTURE OF BRITISH NORTH AMERICA.">
