    <node id="COMMANDANT">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">COMMANDANT was a military commander and the commandant of the town of Reni, where he held authority over both local administration and military affairs. In this dual capacity, he was responsible for overseeing matters of governance and defense, and he was directly involved in decisions regarding hospital supplies. Specifically, he was asked about the provision and management of medical supplies for the local hospital, indicating his role in logistical and public health-related administrative decisions. His position combined military leadership with civilian administrative duties, making him a key figure in the town's overall management and crisis response.
Relationships:
  - Source: MATRON
  - Target: COMMANDANT
  - Description: Matron asked the Commandant about hospital supplies in Reni</data>
