  - Source: ST. PAUL
  - Target: MINNEHAHA ENGINE COMPANY
  - Description: Minnehaha Engine Company is in St. Paul.
  - Source: MINNEHAHA ENGINE COMPANY
  - Target: ST. PAUL FIRE DEPARTMENT
  - Description: Minnehaha Engine Company is part of the St. Paul Fire Department.

