  - Target: CARCHEMISH
  - Description: Carchemish is the great emporium of the Khati; Carchemish was the emporium of the Khati
  - Source: KHATI
  - Target: TYRE
  - Description: The names of the Khati and their cities, including Tyre, have etymology in the Maya language.
