tion. The regiment would have been composed of infantry, cavalry, or artillery, though the type is not specified. Overall, the SEVENTH REGIMENT represents a tangible link to the Civil War, and its story is intertwined with the lives of the men who served, including those who held officer ranks like Pratt.
