    <node id="AS PART OF THE SCIENTIFIC AMERICAN FAMILY OF PUBLICATIONS, THIS SUPPLEMENT WAS DEDICATED TO COVERING A BROAD RANGE OF SCIENTIFIC TOPICS, OFFERING READERS IN-DEPTH ARTICLES AND PAPERS ON CONTEMPORARY SCIENTIFIC DEVELOPMENTS. THE PUBLICATION FUNCTIONED AS A WEEKLY PERIODICAL, AND IN ADDITION TO ITS REGULAR CONTENT, IT PROVIDED A CATALOGUE OF SCIENTIFIC PAPERS, MAKING IT A VALUABLE RESOURCE FOR THOSE SEEKING BOTH CURRENT RESEARCH AND A CURATED LIST OF RELATED SCHOLARLY WORKS. THE SUPPLEMENT PUBLISHED ORIGINAL SCIENTIFIC PAPERS AND CONTRIBUTED TO THE DISSEMINATION OF SCIENTIFIC KNOWLEDGE WITHIN THE BROADER SCIENTIFIC AMERICAN FRAMEWORK.">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">Munn &amp; Co. is the publisher of the Scientific American Supplement
  - Source: SCIENTIFIC AMERICAN SUPPLEMENT
