    <edge source="BEY OF TUNIS" target="TUNIS" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Bey of Tunis is the sovereign ruler associated with the city of Tunis, which serves as the political and administrative center of his domain. The Bey holds authority over Tunis and its government, exercising direct control over the region's governance and administration. As the ruling figure, the Bey's power is centered in Tunis, making the city both his seat of power and the primary locus of his political influence.</data>
