    <edge source="CAPTAIN KNEEBONE" target="MISS DRAKE" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Captain Kneebone and Miss Drake are connected through an act of charitable giving and a shared social setting. Captain Kneebone provides a generous donation of two thousand rupees to Miss Drake, specifically intended to support her hospital and the children under her care. This contribution highlights his philanthropic support for her charitable work. Additionally, both individuals are present at the same dinner event, which places them within a common social context, suggesting an ongoing or at least a cordial acquaintance. Together, these details portray Captain Kneebone as a benefactor and Miss Drake as a recipient of his support, with their interaction occurring within a formal social gathering.</data>
      <data key="d8">CAPTAIN KNEEBONE</data>
    </edge>
