      <data key="d7">Nesbit is an individual who has established a fortified position, or fort, atop a structure referred to as the pony-shed. From this elevated vantage point on the pony-shed, Nesbit actively engages in firing his rifle, indicating that the fort serves as both a defensive and offensive post. The pony-shed itself is the physical foundation for this fort, and all of Nesbit's actionsspecifically, the act of shootingoccur from this location. There is no contradiction in the provided descriptions; both statements consistently place Nesbit and his fort on the pony-shed, with the first adding the detail of rifle fire. Thus, Nesbit is characterized as a rifle-wielding figure who uses the pony-shed as his base of operations, with his fort being the specific structure from which he shoots.</data>
      <data key="d8">NESBIT</data>
    </edge>
