    <edge source="COTE" target="REBELLION" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">COTE was a prominent leader within the REBELLION, playing a key organizational and strategic role in the uprising. Following the failure of the rebellion, COTE fled the region, crossing the American border to escape capture or retribution. As a rebel leader, COTEs actions were central to the movements efforts, and their flight marked the end of their direct involvement in the conflict. The rebellion itself, though significant, ultimately did not succeed, leading to COTEs exile. No further details are provided regarding COTEs fate after crossing the border, but the available information confirms their leadership status and their subsequent departure from the area.</data>
      <data key="d8">COTE</data>
    </edge>
